    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41651" root="وجأ" body-key="w">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اوجأ عَنْهُ</span></b>  <i>He repelled from him; removed,</i>
or <i>put away, from him.</i> (K *, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اوجأ</span> <i>He
came in search of a thing that he wanted,</i> or
<i>in pursuit of game, and did not attain it.</i> (K.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <i>It</i> (a well) <i>failed;</i> i. e., <i>its water ceased:</i>
or <i>it contained no water.</i> (TA.) [See also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْجَى</span>.]

